# 🛡️ HTB Lab – Preignition Security Analysis

> Practical hands-on security lab focused on reconnaissance, web enumeration, hidden content discovery, and authentication weaknesses.

---

## 🎯 Objective

Understand how exposed administrative interfaces and weak authentication controls can lead to unauthorized access.

