# 🧠 Attacker Methodology

```text
Nmap Scan
    ↓
HTTP Service Discovery
    ↓
Default nginx Page
    ↓
Directory Enumeration
    ↓
admin.php Discovery
    ↓
Authentication Testing
    ↓
Default Credentials Successful
    ↓
Administrative Access
```

